    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Newly renovated townhouse, centrally located on a quiet street within a very short walking distance of town (1 minute). Fully furnished with 3 double bedrooms and 2 bathrooms. Private & low maintenance back yard. Energy efficient A3 BER rated with modern air to water heat pump system. Street parking available close by. \n*All bills included i.e. electricity, heating, wi-fi and waste/bin collection.*\nThis clean and beautifully decorated house would suit a couple or family looking to enjoy what the famous town of Kinsale and the County of Cork has to offer. As the official start of the Wild Atlantic Way, Kinsale is full of character with narrow, winding streets lined with brightly colored storefronts, artisan boutiques, top-class restaurants and art galleries. \nUnfortunately not suitable for pets. No smokers please. References required. \n*Available for a 9 to 10 month lease only.*\nKinsale Town Centre: 1 min walk\nCork City Centre: 30 mins drive\nCork Airport: 23 mins drive\nKinsale/Dock beach: 5 mins drive\nFor more information and to arrange a viewing contact fionaquinn@hotmail.com"
      }
    ],
